  - claude-code-plugin
  - model-selection
  - llm-routing
  - reasoning-effort
  - subagents
  - cost-optimization
  - swe-bench
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin and command-line tool that chooses the Claude model (Sonnet or Opus) and reasoning
  effort for each task or subagent from the task text, its labels and the repository, keeps an outcome log
  that suggests better rules, and publishes a repeatable SWE-bench Verified benchmark comparing fixed
  choices, climbing on failure, the router and the hindsight optimum.
